<span id="alg2.l2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <em id="alg2.l2.4.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">(A) Agent-level inner updates: </em> <math id="alg2.l2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta^{(k)}\to\theta^{(k+1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta^{(k)}\to\theta^{(k+1)}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span></span>
