<th id="S5.T2.4.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">SMART-LLM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>]</cite> (GPT-4o)</th>
<td id="S5.T2.4.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.70</td>
